@startuml
title Resumefolio | Finding disposition and actual recheck
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Identify reviewed input revision, method and bounded actual observation;
:Record finding, affected records, evidence, impact and owner;
:Obtain actual owner disposition under applicable authority;
if (Correction selected?) then (yes)
 :Change the affected primary records and related links under scope;
 :Identify new revision and perform actual relevant recheck;
 if (Correction supported and impacts reconciled?) then (yes)
  :Record resolved disposition with actual evidence; <<#DCFCE7>>
 else (unmet / incomplete)
  :Keep finding open with next action and gate; <<#FEF3C7>>
 endif
else (other disposition)
 :Record justified rejection / permitted deferral only if actually decided;
 :Retain rationale, authority, gate and remaining obligations; <<#FEF3C7>>
endif
:Assess baseline readiness separately against identified candidate;
stop
legend bottom
Proposed procedure; RF-D01-D05 remain open in this revision.
A proposed fix, source link or rendered diagram is not closure evidence.
Requirements review is separate from actual product test / release acceptance.
endlegend
@enduml
